{
	$version: "0.1.71.1"
	name: "02: Settling"
	category: "00: Essentials"
	desc:
		'''
		The basis of any base is a spawnpoint. Factions should start with tents, while neutrals start with taverns.
		These buildings will supply limitless amounts of the simplest tools required for setup.
		'''
	
	order: 2
	size: [456, 0]
	layout: a
	flags: none
	
	title: "Getting Started"
	sprite_scale: 6
	sprite:
	{
		texture: ui_icons_widget
		size: [16, 16]
		frame: [3, 0]
	}
	entries:
	[
		{
			text: "Punch with RMB with empty hands. Holding RMB allows some tools to hit objects they usually cannot."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Wood can be obtained by punching trees, or purchased for cheap at a market if you found anything to trade with."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "A basic wrench can be crafted directly from wood by interacting with yourself, use the hammer and wrench icon in your hotbar."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "In the buildings tab of your wrench, construct either a tavern or tent. These provide basic tools."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "If you create a faction at a tent, you will get a small claim radius, this prevents others from building in your land."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Doors and walls help keep things out. Just remember to lock any doors with Shift + E."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
	]
}